# 统一换行符策略:仓库内统一 LF,工作区换行符由本地 git 配置决定
# 用于消除 Windows 检出导致的 CRLF 噪音(详见 doc/quanx-ui/plan.md)
* text=auto

# 二进制文件不做换行符转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.so binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.jar binary
*.zip binary
